{"verse_key": "10:11", "surah": 10, "verse": 11, "text_uthmani": "۞ وَلَوْ يُعَجِّلُ ٱللَّهُ لِلنَّاسِ ٱلشَّرَّ ٱسْتِعْجَالَهُم بِٱلْخَيْرِ لَقُضِىَ إِلَيْهِمْ أَجَلُهُمْ ۖ فَنَذَرُ ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يَرْجُونَ لِقَآءَنَا فِى طُغْيَـٰنِهِمْ يَعْمَهُونَ", "translation": "And if Allāh was to hasten for the people the evil [they invoke]<sup foot_note=196435>1</sup> as He hastens for them the good, their term would have been ended for them.<sup foot_note=196434>2</sup> But We leave the ones who do not expect the meeting with Us, in their transgression, wandering blindly.", "verse_from_ms": 216760, "verse_to_ms": 238890, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "۞", "start_ms": 216760, "end_ms": 217770}, {"i": 1, "text": "وَلَوْ", "start_ms": 217770, "end_ms": 218740}, {"i": 2, "text": "يُعَجِّلُ", "start_ms": 218740, "end_ms": 219510}, {"i": 3, "text": "ٱللَّهُ", "start_ms": 219510, "end_ms": 220790}, {"i": 4, "text": "لِلنَّاسِ", "start_ms": 220790, "end_ms": 221490}, {"i": 5, "text": "ٱلشَّرَّ", "start_ms": 221490, "end_ms": 223620}, {"i": 6, "text": "ٱسْتِعْجَالَهُم", "start_ms": 223620, "end_ms": 224480}, {"i": 7, "text": "بِٱلْخَيْرِ", "start_ms": 224480, "end_ms": 225310}, {"i": 8, "text": "لَقُضِىَ", "start_ms": 225310, "end_ms": 226360}, {"i": 9, "text": "إِلَيْهِمْ", "start_ms": 226360, "end_ms": 228110}, {"i": 10, "text": "أَجَلُهُمْ", "start_ms": 228110, "end_ms": 228940}, {"i": 11, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 228940, "end_ms": 229950}, {"i": 12, "text": "فَنَذَرُ", "start_ms": 229950, "end_ms": 230280}, {"i": 13, "text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 230280, "end_ms": 231290}, {"i": 14, "text": "لَا", "start_ms": 231290, "end_ms": 233820}, {"i": 15, "text": "يَرْجُونَ", "start_ms": 233820, "end_ms": 234230}, {"i": 16, "text": "لِقَآءَنَا", "start_ms": 234230, "end_ms": 235710}, {"i": 17, "text": "فِى", "start_ms": 235710, "end_ms": 238445}, {"i": 18, "text": "طُغْيَـٰنِهِمْ", "start_ms": null, "end